    "intro_narrative": "Welcome to the Sanctum of the Archmage. You are an ambitious apprentice who has sneaked into your master's forbidden observatory while he is away on council business. Legend speaks of the elusive Ethereal Grimoire, a legendary spellbook that holds the secrets to weaving reality itself. It is hidden away in this very chamber, protected by layers of ancient magic, arcane mechanisms, and complex celestial puzzles.\n\nTo prove your worth and acquire the ultimate arcane knowledge, you must navigate the room's interconnected magical devices. The master has left behind various enchanted tools, runic tablets, and relics scattered across the observatory. You will need to carefully deduce how to power these artifacts by tracing the flow of arcane energy between them. Unravel the mysteries of the planetary leylines, align the stars, break the magical seals, and claim the grimoire before the Archmage returns. Your future as a powerful wizard depends entirely on your success tonight.",
    "narrative_style": "fantasy"
  },
